\name{Acetaminophen_pos}
\alias{acetaminophen}
\title{MetaboAnnotatoR fragment database entry for Acetaminophen Positive mode}
\description{
This dataset is an example of a MetaboAnnotatoR database entry. 
It is a data table containing the Acetaminophen fragments and respective score weights.
The database entry was generated from one of the MassBank entries for Acetaminophen
(\href{https://massbank.eu/MassBank/RecordDisplay?id=MSBNK-Athens_Univ-AU276702}{MSBNK-Athens_Univ-AU276702}) 
using function \code{MetaboAnnotatoR::genFragEntry()}.
}

\seealso{
  \code{\link[MetaboAnnotatoR]{genFragEntry}}
  
\author{
Goncalo Graca
}
